0 FILE 10183 - 8 - Diesel-electric American locomotive 2.ldr
0 Diesel-electric American locomotive with red and black livery, twin three-axle bogies with magnetic couplings, double-ended sloped noses, glazed cab with windows, side and roof ventilation grilles, head/tail lamps and side handrails
